// Installed by Eduka-Update-System.
//
// Edukasaun OS follows Debian "stable" without a release codename and is
// updated continuously. When Debian publishes a new stable release (for
// example trixie -> forky), the archive changes its Codename and Version.
// APT normally stops updating until someone confirms that change; these
// options accept it, so package lists keep updating. Eduka-Update-System
// then shows the new release as one "major system update" and installs it
// safely (snapshot, minimal upgrade, full upgrade, clean-up). Origin and
// Label changes are still refused.
Acquire::AllowReleaseInfoChange::Codename "true";
Acquire::AllowReleaseInfoChange::Version "true";
Acquire::AllowReleaseInfoChange::Suite "true";
